// P36.42a (SIG-UI-070): a later page of one type's A–Z list
// (`/entity/<type>/page/<n>/`, n ≥ 2 — page 1 is the type's index route).
import BaseLayout from "../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getEntityLabelRows } from "../../../../lib/data";
import { entityIndex } from "../../../../lib/entity-page";
import { kindPlural, paginate, typeList } from "../../../../lib/entity-pages";
import { withBase } from "../../../../lib/paths";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  const index = entityIndex(getEntityLabelRows());
  const paths: { params: { type: string; n: string } }[] = [];
  for (const k of index.kinds) {
    const list = typeList(index, k.kind);
    const pages = Math.ceil(list.published.length / 100);
    for (let n = 2; n <= pages; n++) {
      paths.push({ params: { type: k.kind, n: String(n) } });
    }
  }
  return paths;
}

const { type, n } = Astro.params;
const index = entityIndex(getEntityLabelRows());
const list = typeList(index, type);
const page = paginate(list.published, Number(n));
const kindMeta = index.kinds.find((k) => k.kind === type);
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`${kindPlural(type)} — A–Z, page ${page.page}`}
  path={withBase(`entity/${type}/page/${page.page}/`)}
  crumbs={[
    { label: "Organizations", href: withBase("entity/") },
    { label: kindPlural(type), href: withBase(`entity/${type}/`) },
    { label: `Page ${page.page}` },
  ]}
>
  <p class="sig-lede">
    <a href={withBase("entity/")}>All entity types</a>
    {" · "}
    <a href={withBase(`entity/${type}/`)}>{kindPlural(type)}</a>
    {" · page "}
    {page.page} of {page.pages}.
  </p>
  <ul class="sig-entity-list" role="list" data-testid="entity-list">
    {page.rows.map((row) => (
      <li data-testid="entity-row">
        <a href={withBase(`entity/${row.url_type}/${row.slug}--${row.hash}/`)}>{row.label}</a>
        {row.descriptor && <span class="sig-entity-list__descriptor"> — {row.descriptor}</span>}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <p class="sig-table-note">
    {Array.from({ length: page.pages }, (_, i) => (
      <>
        {i > 0 && " · "}
        {i + 1 === page.page ? (
          <span aria-current="page">{i + 1}</span>
        ) : i === 0 ? (
          <a href={withBase(`entity/${type}/`)}>1</a>
        ) : (
          <a href={withBase(`entity/${type}/page/${i + 1}/`)}>{i + 1}</a>
        )}
      </>
    ))}
    {" — "}
    {kindMeta?.er_disclosure}
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
